      "sentence": {
        "text": "<p>Read the opinion. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><em>I believe that people should not swim with dolphins.</em></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Drag and drop the sentence that states the <em>same</em> opinion to the table.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Original Opinion</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Re-written Opinion</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">I believe that people should not swim with dolphins.</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\"> @_@ </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src=\"../alef-assessment-content/data/ccl/assessment/questions/2023/09/25/09/29/fzILw1G7I0.jpg\"/> </p>"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "swappable": false,
          "swapGroupId": 0,
          "position": null
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dolphins and people should not swim together."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dolphins and people often swim together."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "People like to swim with dolphins."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "People can swim with dolphins."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
